 attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east. A retry finished the job.\n- **Result:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service now reports healthy, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. The incident had been created, so there's no duplicate and on-call was paged only once.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback and the orchestrator error. It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}